 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "Threads, runnables and printing are replaced by a deterministic clock passed in by the caller. DelayedTaskScheduler() starts empty. schedule(taskId, delayTime, currentTime) registers a pending task to run at currentTime + delayTime and returns that run time (instead of printing it). runDue(currentTime) runs every pending task whose run time is <= currentTime and returns their ids ordered by run time, then by scheduling order; they are no longer pending. cancel(taskId) returns true and removes the task when it is pending, otherwise false. currentTime never decreases across schedule and runDue calls, and task ids are unique among schedule calls. Every method call is answered in call order on one instance; void methods return nothing.",
  "provenance": [
   {
    "repository": "gamma",
    "revision": null,
    "path": "projects/algorithm_solver/catalogue/authored/hack2hire-chunk10-a-20261028-v1/contracts.json",
    "sha256": "be5d798382a43847401e76609d79932746e664be0d91c81b132bf6b46cd69126",
    "selector": "/problems/10/inferred_spec"
   }
  ]
 },
 "contentScope": "authored",
 "requirements": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": [
   "Threads, runnables and printing are replaced by a deterministic clock passed in by the caller.",
   "DelayedTaskScheduler() starts empty.",
   "schedule(taskId, delayTime, currentTime) registers a pending task to run at currentTime + delayTime and returns that run time (instead of printing it).",
   "runDue(currentTime) runs every pending task whose run time is <= currentTime and returns their ids ordered by run time, then by scheduling order; they are no longer pending.",
   "cancel(taskId) returns true and removes the task when it is pending, otherwise false.",
   "currentTime never decreases across schedule and runDue calls, and task ids are unique among schedule calls.",
   "Every method call is answered in call order on one instance; void methods return nothing."
  ],
